== the routes, read out of the router ==
  GET /api/links  -  List links
  POST /api/links  -  Save a link
  GET /api/links/{id}  -  One link
  DELETE /api/links/{id}  -  Forget a link
  GET /health

== the schemas, read out of the types ==
  Page: total items
  Link: id url page_title status note tags
  Status: ["Active","Broken"]
  NewLink: url page_title note
  Problem: error detail

== what the compiler derived for Link ==
{"title":"Link","description":"a saved link, as the API hands it back","type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"assigned when the link is saved, and never reused"},"url":{"type":"string","description":"where the link points"},"page_title":{"type":"string","description":"the page's own title, as it was when the link was saved"},"status":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Status"},"note":{"type":"string","description":"whatever the saver wanted to remember about it"},"tags":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"free-form labels, for finding it again"}},"required":["id","url","page_title","status","tags"],"additionalProperties":false}

== a response that names a header ==
{"Location":{"description":"where the saved link now lives","schema":{"type":"string"}}}

